# Interop golden vector (issue #7, shared canonical fixtures).
# The committed Java/backend vector credential verifies through the real
# OfflineAuthSession; the same bytes are reused by PWA (#8) and backend tests.
name: ble-vector-interop
version: 1
description: Golden offline-credential vector through the production verifier.

boot
import_fixture_node vector
claim_mode_enter
claim_as admin
assert last_claim ok
assert claim_state CLAIMED
phone_connect
provide_credential vector
assert last_auth ok
assert ble_authorized
owner
phone_disconnect
